# Private-data guardrails for the public my-agent-extensions repo.
#
# The blocking pre-commit hook (scripts/pre-commit) rejects any staged line matching these
# patterns (grep -E). They are CLASSES of secrets / deployment identifiers — high-signal, low
# false-positive. Never commit real credentials, tokens, or deployment-specific network/host
# identifiers. If you authored a connector on your own machine, sanitize it first (see
# CONTRIBUTING.md).
#
# One pattern per line; lines starting with # are comments.

# Secret / API key material
sk-ant-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{20,}
AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}
gh[pousr]_[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}
xox[baprs]-[A-Za-z0-9-]{10,}
-----BEGIN [A-Z ]*PRIVATE KEY-----

# Deployment / private network identifiers
\.ts\.net
\b10\.[0-9]{1,3}\.[0-9]{1,3}\.[0-9]{1,3}\b
\b192\.168\.[0-9]{1,3}\.[0-9]{1,3}\b
\b100\.(6[4-9]|[7-9][0-9]|1[0-1][0-9]|12[0-7])\.[0-9]{1,3}\.[0-9]{1,3}\b

# Absolute home paths (leak a username / machine layout)
/home/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+/
/Users/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+/
